This project includes display initialization and TE-synchronized transfer
logic adapted from:

- eMUQI/esp-mosaico-fluidbox (MIT)
- esp-mosaico/esp-mosaico-bsp (Apache-2.0)

The top-right connection and battery status treatment follows the published
AMOLED UI guidelines of eMUQI/QuotaFrame. That project is MPL-2.0; this
repository reimplements the status bar instead of copying its source.

The CO5300 panel command sequence is subject to the Apache-2.0 license.
See licenses/Apache-2.0.txt if redistributing that portion.
